o;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>She knew that I have experience and asked if I had any advice for her daughter. This is little Drax and we’re 99% sure he’s totally blind. That may explain what he’s doing here haha</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/xxvw9Lm.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Her daughter Kate is killing it, though! She didn’t need my help! Well, she very much appreciated the advice I gave her about the plastic put-together pen that can keep them contained</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/LizQtwU.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Chaos</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/KRaJIoK.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Num num num</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/EfjyGrz.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Face-first into the wet food. She requires a bath after every meal lol</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ItjkLYN.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Snuggle time</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/t3S1cit.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Perfect little face</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/lDoPSDj.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>They have a LOT of opinions</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/fkQeY3F.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I love them so much even though I have not met them.</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/b3Vu8vE</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[KittensForDays]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Mitchy</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/RTqvvnI</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/J93GLAZ.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><sp