>8. Hungarian: XHYZYAHyhAYZ</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/dk9vdI9.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>9. Arnold just fits everything, doesn't he</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/PLSBuBD.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>10. May you be as I don't give a fuck as this cat</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/lI7sND7.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>11. Is Boeing making boats now too??</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/uKNGl08.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>12. When you try to reuse a glitch from 2 years ago but it's already been patched.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/LwzvXl5.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>13. 88</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/Z1hFWoB.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>14. "I'll just try and prank him on this slippery floor, what could go wrong?"</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/eE7W1Eb.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>15. Long read: 
So on some subreddits and on twitter I've see a lot of dudes that managed to get GPT or Claude to hallucinate "GTA" or "Skyrim" for them and I just don't get what's the purpose or the goal of it. I'm a game dev who's made three games so far and working on my fourth one. Working on games and working with voice actors is so much fun, I can't imagine getting any kind of pleasure from typing prompts 100 times to get something broken, ugly and barely playable.

From personal experience, yes some part of game dev are boring like making subtitles or texturing models, but starting and completing an idea is so amazing and also making a game that people want to play is genuinely rewarding.

Under these AI bros posts all I see comments like "Wow, looks good, what was your prompt" instead of "Wow, I want to play this" .

If you want to support my work, please check out the game I'm working on (psychological horror/ moral dilemma sim): https://store.steampowered.com/app/2719670/The_Milgram_Experiment/</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/w7IX8B2</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[TheseusGames]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Can’t make this stuff up</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/dZBECM9</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/6V3Bt0Q.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/pEYZ0bK.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/forklift-hit-kennedy-center-pillars/</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/dZBECM9</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[moecurlylarry]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Memes/tomfoolery</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/elqLG4C</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/8DIKvXm.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/QvkI6W3.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/EUbRlXU.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/D8O2Hqc.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/w0Votmf.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/msPAlz7.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/XeStXqC.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/zbu5eb3.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/su